633
00:41:26,609 --> 00:41:27,735
Good.

634
00:41:27,818 --> 00:41:30,571
Sir, the plan is to go
after the governor first,

635
00:41:30,655 --> 00:41:32,865
and when the general
comes to his defense,

636
00:41:32,948 --> 00:41:35,660
we use his hot mic comments
to take him down, too.

637
00:41:38,204 --> 00:41:40,081
Congratulations, sir.

638
00:41:40,790 --> 00:41:42,042
I wanted to be the first to say it.

639
00:41:43,459 --> 00:41:45,086
We still have to campaign.

640
00:41:46,087 --> 00:41:48,798
Yeah, but you're going to win.

